#ASSERT NOT (`reg 8(4) — the person is a care leaver` `an English young person with no care leaver status`)
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 8(4) — the person is a care leaver` `an English young person with only a Welsh category`)
#ASSERT `reg 8(4) — the person is a care leaver` `a Welsh category young person`
#ASSERT NOT (`reg 8(4) — the person is a care leaver` `a Welsh young person with only the English status`)
